<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 landscape;
            margin: 0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            width: 297mm;
            height: 210mm;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .certificate {
            width: 297mm;
            height: 210mm;
            padding: 12mm 14mm;
            background: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        /* Barra decorativa superior */
        .top-accent {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 6px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #10b981 100%);
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-bottom: 4mm;
        }

        .logo-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: #0f172a;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .logo-tag {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #64748b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .category-pill {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0369a1;
            background: #f0f9ff;
            border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .main-section {
            margin: auto 0;
        }

        .title-area {
            margin-bottom: 4mm;
        }

        .title-area .eyebrow {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0ea5e9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .title-area h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0f172a;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .name-container {
            margin: 5mm 0 4mm 0;
        }

        .name-container .nome {
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0369a1;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .content-box {
            max-width: 240mm;
        }

        .content-box p {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .content-box strong {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .signatures-area {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            gap: 25mm;
            margin-top: 6mm;
            padding-top: 4mm;
        }

        .signature-item {
            width: 60mm;
        }

        .sig-line {
            height: 1px;
            background: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .sig-name {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .sig-role {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-top: 3mm;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .code-tag {
            font-family: monospace;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #475569;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="certificate">
        <div class="top-accent"></div>

        <div class="header">
            <div>
                <div class="logo-title">{{#if instituicao}}{{instituicao}}{{else}}Instituto Federal de Pernambuco{{/if}}</div>
                <div class="logo-tag">{{#if subInstituicao}}{{subInstituicao}}{{else}}Campus Igarassu{{/if}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-pill">{{#if subtitulo}}{{subtitulo}}{{else}}Certificado de Participação{{/if}}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="main-section">
            <div class="title-area">
                <div class="eyebrow">Declaração Oficial</div>
                <h1>{{#if titulo}}{{titulo}}{{else}}Certificado{{/if}}</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="name-container">
                <span class="nome">{{nome}}</span>
            </div>

            <div class="content-box">
                <p>
                    {{#if textoPersonalizado}}
                        {{textoPersonalizado}}
                    {{else}}
                        Concluiu com sucesso sua participação no evento <strong>{{evento}}</strong>, realizado na data de <strong>{{data}}</strong>{{#if cargaHoraria}}, totalizando uma carga horária de <strong>{{cargaHoraria}}</strong>{{/if}}.
                    {{/if}}
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="signatures-area">
                <div class="signature-item">
                    <div class="sig-line"></div>
                    <div class="sig-name">{{#if assinaturaNome}}{{assinaturaNome}}{{else}}Liliane Alves{{/if}}</div>
                    <div class="sig-role">{{#if assinaturaCargo}}{{assinaturaCargo}}{{else}}Coordenadora do Evento{{/if}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="signature-item">
                    <div class="sig-line"></div>
                    <div class="sig-name">{{#if assinatura2Nome}}{{assinatura2Nome}}{{else}}Lincoln Tavares{{/if}}</div>
                    <div class="sig-role">{{#if assinatura2Cargo}}{{assinatura2Cargo}}{{else}}Diretor Geral{{/if}}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div>Autenticidade verificável através da plataforma CertiEvents</div>
            <div>Código: <span class="code-tag">{{certificadoId}}</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
